{"headword":"מַלְכוּת","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f.</strong> royalty, royal power, reign, kingdom (chiefly late);—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:9\" href=\"/Esther.1.9\">Est 1:9</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.23\">1 Ch 12:23</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכוּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.14\">1 Ch 17:14</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְכֻיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 8:22\" href=\"/Daniel.8.22\">Dn 8:22</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>royal power, dominion</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:7\" href=\"/Numbers.24.7\">Nu 24:7</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּנַּשֵּׂא</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:31\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.31\">1 S 20:31</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּכּוֹן</span>), <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:12\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.12\">1 K 2:12</a> (c. <em>id.</em>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.7\">Je 10:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 4:14\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.4.14\">Ec 4:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.10\">1 Ch 11:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.23\">12:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.30\">29:30</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּבוּרָה</span>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.13\">2 Ch 33:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:19\" href=\"/Esther.1.19\">Est 1:19</a>, <em>royal</em> (queenly) <em>dignity</em> <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:14\" href=\"/Esther.4.14\">4:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 14:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.14.2\">1 Ch 14:2</a> (c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נִשֵּׂאת</span>); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָכַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:21\" href=\"/Daniel.11.21\">Dn 11:21</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵכִין</span> (subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 17:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.17.11\">1 Ch 17:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28